    "note": "FreeCAD's patterns cannot repeat SciForge's own extrude (a Python feature), so SciForge's pattern feature copies what it added. Each column is a frustum 20 tall from 10x10 to b = 10 + 40 tan(10 deg) square: V = h/3 (a^2 + b^2 + a b). V = 60*30*10 + 2 * that; faces 6 + 2*(4 sides + top)."
